# YouTube's own player, the usual way a YouTube video plays: lantern-web's
# window over the stage. A running service with the video then a picture:
# it fades in, plays, blacks out and back, pauses and plays on, and the
# plan goes on to the picture when it ends. Needs the network. It plays
# sound: run it with PULSE_SINK set to a null sink to keep it quiet.
add https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jNQXAC9IVRw
add fixtures/image.png
go-on 1
fade 1 2 2
mode start
wait 1500
shot 1-fading-in
wait 6000
shot 2-playing
black
wait 600
shot 3-black
black
pause
wait 1500
shot 4-paused
play
wait 22000
shot 5-went-on
